      "difficulty": "hard",
      "sourcePack": "foundation-06",
      "topic": "Sentence practice",
      "zh": "今天上午很冷，下午有点儿热，所以我想晚上再去买东西。",
      "py": "Jīntiān shàngwǔ hěn lěng, xiàwǔ yǒudiǎnr rè, suǒyǐ wǒ xiǎng wǎnshang zài qù mǎi dōngxi.",
